Package: com.max.kioskmode-app
Name: Kiosk Mode
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Author: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Section: Apps
Priority: optional
Description: Setup app for Kiosk Mode (lock the iPad to one app)
 The onboarding and configuration app for Kiosk Mode: pick which app the device
 should lock to and manage the kiosk settings. The actual lock/auto-relaunch
 behaviour lives in the companion SpringBoard tweak (package com.max.kioskmode);
 install both for the full feature. Escape a locked session with a volume-button
 triple-press.
 .
 Requires AppSync Unified (install it from the https://cydia.akemi.ai/ repo) to
 run this unsigned app. Rootless (/var/jb) jailbreaks only, iOS/iPadOS 17+.
